  "title": "Your Page Title",
  "text_sample": "Your Page Title Jacobsen Fleet Rates Delivery Overview Book a car Rent The fleet Rates and requirements Delivery Chauffeur Book a car Jacobsen How it works About Journal FAQ Contact Overview Car of the month Rolls-Royce Cullinan From \u20ac1,900 a day Puerto Ban\u00fas, Marbella. Delivered anywhere on the Costa del Sol. Book a car Journal . Mountains 12 September 2026 Up to Ronda by the A-397 Fifty-eight kilometres of bends from San Pedro to the gorge, and the best road on the coast for a car with a lot of engine. Start San Pedro de Alc\u00e1ntara Distance 58 km Time About an hour Best season October to May Reading 1 min read The A-397 leaves the coast at San Pedro and climbs straight into the Serran\u00eda de Ronda. Within ten minutes the sea is behind you, the road is cut into pale limestone and there is nothing on either side but pine and rock. The road It is a wide, well-kept mountain road with long sweeping bends rather than tight hairpins, which is why it suits a big supercar. The surface is good, the barriers are solid and the views open up on almost every corner. Go early. By eleven in the morning the tour coaches start coming down, and on a Sunday the cyclists own the first half of the climb.",
